<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FALL AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates fell</p>
<p>at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell one basis point to 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>			 February 6 fix	February 5 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.09 pct		3.10 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.19 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.28 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.37 pct		3.38 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
